    "statement": "There is no evidence for the effectiveness of using genetic modification to make crops unpalatable to primates as a conservation strategy.",
    "citations": []
  },
  {
    "statement": "No evidence was found for the effects on primate populations of using unpalatable buffer crops to prevent primates from entering agricultural areas.",
    "citations": [
      "1438"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "A study on genetically modified crops that produce pesticide focused on butterfly and moth survival rather than on primate deterrence.",
    "citations": [
      "3895"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Chili-based deterrents showed mixed results when used with elephants.",
    "citations": [
      "2492"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Five of seven studies found that chili-based deterrents repelled elephants at least initially.",
    "citations": [
      "2492"
