  {
    "statement": "Loud noise deterrents showed mixed effectiveness in preventing crop damage by mammals.",
    "citations": [
      "2460"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Five of six studies found that loud noises reduced crop damage by various mammals, including elephants and deer.",
    "citations": [
